    "narrative": "The Austin Waves look to capitalize on a favorable matchup against Adrian Houser today, as **Gunnar Henderson** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** emerge as our most potent options. **Gunnar Henderson** leads the way with an elite 75.31 score; while he faces a formidable arm in Logan Gilbert, a significant park factor boost of +16% and a strong position in the batting order elevate his floor. Similarly, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** benefits immensely from the matchup against Houser, utilizing a 14% platoon advantage and a favorable batting order spot to reach a 74.56 efficiency score. **Curtis Mead** also projects well in this environment (63.58), bolstered by an advantageous wind blowing out, making the trio of **Gunnar Henderson**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, and **Curtis Mead** the core of today\u2019s offensive strategy.\n\nThe decision to bench **Nolan Schanuel** was the tightest call of the day, as his 54.71 projection remained competitive but ultimately fell short of the threshold set by the higher-upside profiles in our lineup. While **Nolan Schanuel** offers steady contact, he lacks the situational momentum currently favoring the rest of our active roster. We are managing significant risk today due to the presence of ace arms on the opposing mound; both **Kyle Tucker** (53.46) and **Andy Pages** (47.47) face the elite Paul Skenes, which naturally suppresses their expected output. Furthermore, because all lineups remain \"Pending,\" we are operating under historical batting order assumptions; if **Liam Hicks**, **Miguel Vargas**, or **Nasim Nunez** shift out of their projected spots, their scores will require immediate re-evaluation. Keep a close eye on **Jackson Merrill**, whose +13% platoon edge is vital, even against the tough Chase Burns.",
